Make this project a Sync-Project?

Each text file in a folder you choose becomes a silo, edited on both sides in real time (folder → silo and silo → folder).

• the first silos bind to the folder's files (name order);
• extra files become new silos (up to 100);
• silos without a matching file keep their text.

The folder can be changed later, and the project can be unlinked any time — silos keep their text.

